@startuml
title UML State Chart Diagram


[*] --> Login

state Login
Login : entry / display journey details
Login : do / view journey details
Login : exit / user decides to activate driving mode or choose other options

state "Activate Mode" as ActivateMode
ActivateMode : entry / user activates driving mode
ActivateMode : do / activate driving mode
ActivateMode : exit / transition to next state

state "Choose Option" as ChooseOption
ChooseOption : entry / user chooses other options
ChooseOption : do / choose option
ChooseOption : exit / transition to next state

state EatPlace
EatPlace : entry / select place to eat
EatPlace : do / view menu and order if hungry
EatPlace : exit / transition to next state or back to Login

state AccidentNotification
AccidentNotification : entry / inform relevant authorities in case of accident
AccidentNotification : do / send notifications during driving or in case of an accident
AccidentNotification : exit / transition to next state

state Feedback
Feedback : entry / provide feedback upon journey completion
Feedback : do / give feedback
Feedback : exit / end journey

@enduml
